{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's On-The-Job Training"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Sally's First Article"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le17ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Make and Respond to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "It's important to be polite when you ask for something or respond to requests."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you help me make this article better? "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Making a Request \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to a Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you ... ?<br><br> Could you ... ?<br><br> Will you ... ?<br><br> Would you mind ... ?<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, no problem.<br><br> It would be my pleasure.<br><br> Of course, I'd be happy to.<br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Would you mind completing my survey on ice cream and jobs? "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Giving and Understanding Instructions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you give instructions related to jobs and work, you can use Imperatives. <br>Imperatives are verbs. You do not use the subject. <br>They are often the first word in the sentence."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Start your own business!  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Become an entrepreneur!"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Think about being a software developer."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "counsellor "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who helps others make important decisions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should train to become a counsellor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about jobs and work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "risk-taker "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who is not afraid of doing things that are not certain  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: People who like vanilla ice cream are actually risk-takers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "entrepreneur "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who starts his or her own business"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Start your own business! Become an entrepreneur!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "engineer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a person trained in the construction of buildings, bridges, roads, etc. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: If you are logical and thoughtful, think about being an engineer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "software developer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a person who creates computer programs "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: People who like math make good software developers."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "nurse "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who assists medical doctors"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Being a nurse requires a patient personality."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ask 5 people their favorite ice cream between these choices: vanilla, chocolate, strawberry, chocolate chip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain what type of person that makes them, based on Sally's article."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain what kind of job they should have, according to Sally."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask them if they think this information is true."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a short paragraph explain the results of your study."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the paragraph to the class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I ask people about their favorite ice cream."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about people's personality and jobs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present the results of the the study."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob07re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le17ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Did you know that the type of ice cream you like can reflect your personality?  Your choice of ice cream can even help you choose a rewarding career!<br><br>Vanilla is one of the basic flavors, but people who like vanilla are actually ambitious risk-takers.  Start your own business! Become an entrepreneur!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le17ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "People who like strawberry ice cream are logical. Think about being a software developer. If you're also thoughtful and focused, you could be an engineer.\n<br><br>\nChocolate lovers are definitely creative, but a bit dramatic. Go to acting school, you would be great actor!", "id": 2, "time": "19500", "image": "engenn5le17ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "People who like chocolate chip ice cream are patient. Train to be a counsellor. Nurses also may like this flavor because they are generous.<br><br>I know this study is not very scientific, so could you help me make this article better? Would you mind completing my survey on ice cream and jobs?  Could you visit my blog, Sally's Suitcase? Would you answer a few questions? Thank you very much.  I really appreciate it!", "id": 3, "time": "38000", "image": "engenn5le17ob07re2img01.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le17ob07re2vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "", "image": ""}, {"text": "Did you know that the type of ice cream you like can reflect your personality?  Your choice of ice cream can even help you choose a rewarding career! Vanilla is one of the basic flavors, but people who like vanilla are actually ambitious risk-takers.  Start your own business! Become an entrepreneur!", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": ""}, {"text": "People who like strawberry ice cream are logical. Think about being a software developer. If you're also thoughtful and focused, you could be an engineer.  Chocolate lovers are definitely creative, but a bit dramatic. Go to acting school, you would be great actor!", "id": 2, "time": "18400", "image": ""}, {"text": "People who like chocolate chip ice cream are patient. Train to be a counsellor. Nurses also may like this flavor because they are generous.", "id": 3, "time": "34000", "image": ""}, {"text": "I know this study is not very scientific, so could you help me make this article better? Would you mind completing my survey on ice cream and jobs?  Could you visit my blog, Sally's Suitcase? Would you answer a few questions? Thank you very much.  I really appreciate it!", "id": 4, "time": "43600", "image": ""}]}}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "static", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "Did you know that the type of ice cream you like can reflect your personality? Your choice of ice cream can even help you choose a rewarding career! Vanilla is one of the basic flavors, but people who like vanilla are actually ambitious risk-takers. Start your own business! Become an entrepreneur!<br><br>\nPeople who like strawberry ice cream are logical. Think about being a software developer. If you're also thoughtful and focused, you could be an engineer. Chocolate lovers are definitely creative, but a bit dramatic. Go to acting school, you would be great actor!\nPeople who like chocolate chip ice cream are patient. Train to be a counsellor. Nurses also may like this flavor because they are generous.<br><br>\nI know this study is not very scientific, so could you help me make this article better? Would you mind completing my survey on ice cream and jobs? Could you visit my blog, Sally's Suitcase? Would you answer a few questions? Thank you very much. I really appreciate it!"}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can make and respond to requests."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "  I can give and understand instructions."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you think people in the same job have the same qualities?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "  What type of job needs someone who is generous? Patient? Ambitious?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correc